---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import { CATALOG_VERIFIED_AT, compressors, tools } from '../data/catalog';
import { glossaryTerms } from '../data/glossary';
import { toolTaxonomy } from '../data/taxonomy';
import { createCatalogSnapshot } from '../domain/snapshots';
import { verdictPublication } from '../data/verdict-publication';
import { getCurrentVerdictAudit } from '../data/current-verdict-audit';

const allGuides = await getCollection('guides');
const featuredGuides = allGuides
	.filter((guide) => guide.data.featured)
	.sort((a, b) => b.data.readingTime - a.data.readingTime)
	.slice(0, 4);
const [leadGuide, ...secondaryGuides] = featuredGuides;
const catalogSnapshot = createCatalogSnapshot({ compressors, tools, toolTaxonomy, verifiedAt: CATALOG_VERIFIED_AT });
const scope = catalogSnapshot.scope;
const verdictSnapshot = getCurrentVerdictAudit();
const formatNumber = (value: number) => value.toLocaleString('fr-FR');
---

<BaseLayout title="CompatAir : quel compresseur pour vos outils ?" description="Vérifiez si un compresseur peut alimenter vos outils pneumatiques : débit restitué (FAD), pression, sources constructeur et données manquantes visibles.">
	<div class="home-canvas">
		<section class="home-hero">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="home-hero-copy">
					<h1>Quel compresseur pour vos <em>outils pneumatiques&nbsp;?</em></h1>
					<p class="home-lead">Comparez le besoin en air de vos outils aux caractéristiques publiées des compresseurs.</p>
					<div class="actions home-primary-actions">
						<a class="button primary" href="/calculateur/">Vérifier la compatibilité</a>
						<a class="button" href="/scanner/">Identifier une référence</a>
					</div>
					<nav class="home-shortcuts" aria-label="Autres outils CompatAir">
						<a href="/comparateur/">Comparer des compresseurs</a>
						<a href="/recherche/">Chercher un modèle</a>
						<a href="/guides/professionnels/">Guides pour les professionnels</a>
					</nav>
				</div>
				<nav class="home-catalog-counts" aria-label="Catalogues et guides">
					<a href="/compresseurs/"><strong>{formatNumber(compressors.length)}</strong><span>compresseurs</span></a>
					<a href="/outils-pneumatiques/"><strong>{formatNumber(tools.length)}</strong><span>outils pneumatiques</span></a>
					<a href="/guides/"><strong>{formatNumber(allGuides.length)}</strong><span>guides techniques</span></a>
				</nav>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="home-reading" aria-labelledby="home-guides-title">
			<div class="container">
				<header class="home-section-head">
					<h2 id="home-guides-title">Guides techniques</h2>
					<a href="/guides/">Tous les guides <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
				</header>
				<div class="home-reading-layout">
					{leadGuide && <article class="home-lead-story">
						<p>{leadGuide.data.category} · {leadGuide.data.readingTime} min</p>
						<h3><a href={`/guides/${leadGuide.id}/`}>{leadGuide.data.title}</a></h3>
						<p>{leadGuide.data.description}</p>
					</article>}
					<div class="home-story-list">
						{secondaryGuides.map((guide) => <article>
							<p>{guide.data.category} · {guide.data.readingTime} min</p>
							<h3><a href={`/guides/${guide.id}/`}>{guide.data.title}</a></h3>
						</article>)}
					</div>
				</div>
				<a class="home-glossary-line" href="/glossaire/">Glossaire : {formatNumber(glossaryTerms.length)} définitions techniques <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="home-data" aria-labelledby="home-data-title">
			<div class="container">
				<header class="home-section-head"><h2 id="home-data-title">Données et sources</h2></header>
				<p class="home-data-intro">Les fiches indiquent les valeurs constructeur, leurs sources et les informations manquantes. Le calcul compare la consommation de l’outil au <a href="/glossaire/#fad">débit restitué (FAD)</a> du compresseur, à la pression de travail.</p>
				<nav class="home-data-links" aria-label="Documentation du catalogue">
					<a href="/methodologie/">Méthode de calcul</a>
					<a href="/sources-fiabilite/">Sources et fiabilité</a>
					<a href="/graphe-preuve/">Documents derrière un verdict</a>
					<a href="/observatoire-qualite-documentaire/">Corrections du catalogue</a>
					<a href="/radar-contradictions/">Contradictions entre fiches</a>
					<a href="/barometre-transparence/">Documentation par marque</a>
					<a href="/affiliation/">Indépendance éditoriale</a>
					<a href="/professionnels/">Services professionnels</a>
				</nav>

				<details class="home-snapshot-scope">
					<summary>Chiffres et limites du catalogue</summary>
					<p>Le catalogue couvre {formatNumber(scope.explorable_combination_count)} couples outil-compresseur : {formatNumber(scope.fixed_verdict_count)} à débit fixe et {formatNumber(scope.parametric_combination_count)} liés à des besoins par action, au gonflage ou à des données incomplètes.</p>
					<p>Distribution calculée le <time datetime={CATALOG_VERIFIED_AT}>{CATALOG_VERIFIED_AT}</time> sur {formatNumber(verdictSnapshot.pairCount)} couples à débit fixe :</p>
					<dl class="home-verdict-mix">
						<div><dt>Compatible en continu</dt><dd>{formatNumber(verdictSnapshot.summary.continuous)}</dd></div>
						<div><dt>Incompatible</dt><dd>{formatNumber(verdictSnapshot.summary.incompatible)}</dd></div>
						<div><dt>Données insuffisantes</dt><dd>{formatNumber(verdictSnapshot.summary.insufficient_data)}</dd></div>
						<div><dt>Verdicts conclusifs</dt><dd>{verdictSnapshot.conclusive.percentage.toLocaleString('fr-FR')} %</dd></div>
					</dl>
					<p>« Données insuffisantes » signale une valeur manquante pour conclure : débit à la pression utile, taux de marche ou consommation en charge. Les {formatNumber(scope.parametric_tool_count)} profils non fixes sont exclus de cette distribution.</p>
					<p>Définitions : <a href="/glossaire/#debit-aspire">débit aspiré</a> et <a href="/glossaire/#interpolation">interpolation</a>.</p>
					<a href={verdictPublication.legacyArchive.verdicts}>Audit historique archivé</a>
				</details>

				<details class="home-demo">
					<summary>Démonstration vidéo</summary>
					<p id="home-demo-description">Identifier une référence et vérifier une configuration.</p>
					<div class="home-video-stage" data-home-video-stage>
						<video data-home-video controls preload="metadata" playsinline aria-label="Démonstration de CompatAir" aria-describedby="home-demo-description">
							<source src="/media/compatair-parcours-utilisateur-complet.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
							Votre navigateur ne permet pas de lire cette vidéo.
						</video>
					</div>
				</details>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.home-canvas { --home-paper: #f3f0e8; --home-ink: #102a20; --home-line: rgba(16, 42, 32, .18); background: var(--home-paper); }
	.home-hero { padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.5rem) 0 0; background: radial-gradient(circle at 15% 4%, rgba(211, 235, 86, .16), transparent 24rem), #f7f4ec; }
	.home-hero-copy { max-width: 58rem; padding-bottom: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem); }
	.home-hero-copy h1 { margin: 0; color: var(--home-ink); font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 5.3vw, 4.4rem); font-weight: 480; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -.035em; text-wrap: balance; }
	.home-hero-copy h1 em { color: var(--brand); font-weight: inherit; }
	.home-lead { max-width: 42rem; margin: 1.25rem 0 0; color: #455c51; font-size: 1.06rem; line-height: 1.6; }
	.home-primary-actions { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
	.home-shortcuts { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .25rem 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
	.home-shortcuts a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; color: var(--brand-dark); font-size: .85rem; text-underline-offset: .2em; }
	.home-catalog-counts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); border-block: 1px solid var(--home-line); }
	.home-catalog-counts a { display: grid; min-width: 0; gap: .4rem; padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem; color: var(--home-ink); text-decoration: none; }
	.home-catalog-counts a + a { border-left: 1px solid var(--home-line); }
	.home-catalog-counts strong { font: 520 clamp(2rem, 3.4vw, 3rem)/1.1 "Newsreader Variable", Georgia, serif; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
	.home-catalog-counts span { font-size: .9rem; }
	.home-catalog-counts a:hover span { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: .2em; }
	.home-reading, .home-data { padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem); }
	.home-section-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
	.home-section-head h2 { margin: 0; color: var(--home-ink); font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.3vw, 2.7rem); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.15; }
	.home-section-head > a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .6rem; min-height: 44px; color: var(--brand-dark); font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 750; text-underline-offset: .2em; }
	.home-reading-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); border-block: 1px solid var(--home-line); }
	.home-lead-story { padding: 1.6rem 2rem 1.6rem 0; border-right: 1px solid var(--home-line); }
	.home-lead-story > p:first-child, .home-story-list article p { margin: 0 0 .6rem; color: var(--brand-dark); font-size: .75rem; }
	.home-lead-story h3 { margin: 0 0 .9rem; font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 3vw, 2.4rem); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.15; }
	.home-lead-story h3 a, .home-story-list h3 a { color: var(--home-ink); text-decoration: none; }
	.home-lead-story h3 a:hover, .home-story-list h3 a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: .15em; }
	.home-lead-story > p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; color: #455c51; }
	.home-story-list { display: grid; align-content: start; padding-left: 2rem; }
	.home-story-list article { padding: 1.3rem 0; }
	.home-story-list article + article { border-top: 1px solid var(--home-line); }
	.home-story-list h3 { margin: 0; font: 530 clamp(1.2rem, 2vw, 1.5rem)/1.2 "Newsreader Variable", Georgia, serif; }
	.home-glossary-line { display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; min-height: 44px; padding-block: 1.25rem; color: var(--brand-dark); font-size: .9rem; text-underline-offset: .2em; }
	.home-data { border-top: 1px solid var(--home-line); background: #f9f7f1; }
	.home-data-intro { max-width: 50rem; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: #455c51; }
	.home-data-links { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: .3rem 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
	.home-data-links a { display: flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; color: var(--brand-dark); font-size: .85rem; text-underline-offset: .2em; }
	.home-snapshot-scope, .home-demo { padding-block: .4rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--home-line); }
	.home-snapshot-scope summary, .home-demo summary { min-height: 44px; padding-block: .7rem; color: var(--home-ink); font-weight: 750; cursor: pointer; }
	.home-snapshot-scope p, .home-demo p { max-width: 60rem; color: #455c51; font-size: .9rem; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
	.home-snapshot-scope > a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; color: var(--brand-dark); font-size: .85rem; }
	.home-verdict-mix { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-block: 1.25rem; }
	.home-verdict-mix > div { min-width: 0; }
	.home-verdict-mix dt { color: #455c51; font-size: .8rem; }
	.home-verdict-mix dd { margin: .4rem 0 0; color: var(--home-ink); font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.1vw, 1.65rem); font-weight: 750; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
	.home-video-stage { width: 100%; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--home-line); border-radius: .75rem; background: #06140e; }
	.home-video-stage video { display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; object-fit: contain; background: #06140e; }
	.home-video-stage video:fullscreen { width: 100vw; height: 100vh; object-fit: contain; background: black; }

	@media (max-width: 760px) {
		.home-reading-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.home-lead-story { padding-right: 0; border-right: 0; }
		.home-story-list { padding-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--home-line); }
		.home-data-links, .home-verdict-mix { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
	}

	@media (max-width: 480px) {
		.home-primary-actions { display: grid; }
		.home-primary-actions .button { width: 100%; }
		.home-shortcuts { display: grid; gap: 0; }
		.home-catalog-counts a { padding: 1rem .55rem; }
		.home-catalog-counts strong { font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 6vw, 1.8rem); white-space: nowrap; }
		.home-catalog-counts span { font-size: .75rem; line-height: 1.4; }
		.home-verdict-mix { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
	}
</style>
